  "subject": "Welcome to GitBook!",
  "html": "<html>\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Welcome to GitBook!</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#111111;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#111111;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 10px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;\">\n<tr><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:0 8px 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"><a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"color:#888888;text-decoration:underline;\">View in browser</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 8px 16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:3px;\">&#9634; GITBOOK</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6d365 0%,#fda085 15%,#a8e063 30%,#56ab2f 40%,#83a4d4 55%,#b6fbff 70%,#f857a6 85%,#ff5858 100%);padding:36px 20px;\" align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:18px 22px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:11px;color:#999999;\">&#9679; &#9679; &#9679; &nbsp; Documentation</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;\">Welcome guide</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td style=\"padding-right:14px;font-size:11px;color:#999999;\">&#9776; Overview<br>&#9734; Quickstart<br>&#9783; Publishing</td>\n<td style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fdfbfb 0%,#ebedee 100%);border-radius:6px;padding:14px 20px;font-size:11px;color:#999999;\">Your docs,<br>beautifully<br>published.</td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:24px 8px 0;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">Hey {{.FirstName}},</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;\">Welcome to GitBook!</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;color:#bbbbbb;\">We're excited to have you here – and even more excited for you to start getting the most out of your team's technical knowledge.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#bbbbbb;\">Publishing beautiful docs has never been easier, and we're here to get you started in just a few clicks.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 auto;\"><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#3884ff\" style=\"border-radius:8px;\"><a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 40px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">Publish your first site</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;\">Need some inspiration?</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;color:#bbbbbb;\">Whether you need some insight to all of the exciting features that GitBook has to offer or want some inspo on how others are using the platform, you can find our top resources below.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#1e1e2e;border-radius:10px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 10px;font-size:34px;\">&#9783;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12px;\"><a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">Read our documentation</a></p></td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#1e1e2e;border-radius:10px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 10px;font-size:34px;\">&#9736;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12px;\"><a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">Sync your docs with GitHub</a></p></td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#1e1e2e;border-radius:10px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 10px;font-size:34px;\">&#9719;</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:12px;\"><a href=\"{{.URL}}\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\">Join our community</a></p></td>\n</tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;color:#bbbbbb;\">The GitBook team</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-size:20px;color:#ffffff;\">&#9634;</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px 8px 20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#777777;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Recipient: {{.Email}} &nbsp;|&nbsp; ID: {{.RId}} &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"{{.BaseURL}}/unsubscribe?rid={{.RId}}\" style=\"color:#777777;\">unsubscribe</a></p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<!-- تتبع الفتح - لازم يفضل موجود -->\n{{.Tracker}}\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "text": "GitBook - Welcome!\n\nHey {{.FirstName}},\n\nWelcome to GitBook!\nWe're excited to have you here - and even more excited for you to start getting the most out of your team's technical knowledge.\nPublishing beautiful docs has never been easier, and we're here to get you started in just a few clicks.\n\nPublish your first site: {{.URL}}\n\nNeed some inspiration?\n- Read our documentation: {{.URL}}\n- Sync your docs with GitHub: {{.URL}}\n- Join our community: {{.URL}}\n\nThe GitBook team\n\nRecipient: {{.Email}} | ID: {{.RId}}\nUnsubscribe: {{.BaseURL}}/unsubscribe?rid={{.RId}}",
